@startuml activity-chat-answer
!include style.iuml
title How the assistant answers a message (activity)

|Phone app|
start
:Person types a question, or speaks it
and checks the recognised words;
:Send it with the access token;
|Backend|
:Gateway: valid token, permission chatbot:use,
per-address and per-account request limits;
:Find the person's own conversation;
if (More questions in the last hour\nthan the chat limit?) then (yes)
  :Answer "try again in N minutes"
  (429 with Retry-After);
  |Phone app|
  :Show the wait time;
  stop
endif
|Backend|
:checkQuestion (safety rules, always first);
if (Self-harm or emergency signs?) then (yes)
  :Fixed urgent-care text
  (URGENT_CARE);
elseif (Doses, prescriptions or\nwhich medicine to take?) then (yes)
  :Fixed "ask your clinician" text
  (DECLINED);
elseif (A patient asking what their\nown result means?) then (yes)
  :Fixed "your clinician explains
  your results" text (DECLINED);
elseif (Small talk? (18 kinds, whole\nmessage only)) then (yes)
  :Friendly fixed reply,
  varied by turn;
else (a health question)
  |AI service|
  :BM25 search of the reviewed knowledge base
  (short follow-ups are read with the previous question);
  if (A passage scores at least 2.0?) then (yes)
    if (Meaning search ready, and a turn\nfree within 0.5 s?) then (yes)
      :MedCPT orders those passages by meaning;
      :Drop the answer if the closest scores under 52.0
      (a follow-up must also reach it on its own);
    else (no: keywords only)
    endif
    if (A passage left to answer from?) then (yes)
      if (Claude switched on, and it answers\nonly from passages it cites?) then (yes)
        :Answer written by Claude
        from the passages ("GENERATED");
      else (no: the default)
        :Quote the best passage, and a second
        one if it is almost as close ("EXTRACTIVE");
      endif
      |Backend|
      if (checkAnswer: has a source, no dose,\nnot too long?) then (passes)
        :Answer with its sources
        and review status;
      else (fails)
        :Fixed "no reviewed information"
        text (NO_SOURCE);
      endif
    else (no)
      |Backend|
      :Fixed "no reviewed information"
      text (NO_SOURCE);
    endif
  else (no)
    |Backend|
    :Fixed "no reviewed information"
    text (NO_SOURCE);
  endif
endif
|Backend|
:Save the question and the answer in MongoDB
(deleted 180 days after the last message);
:Audit event chat.asked: safety, mode,
number of sources (never the text);
:Add the disclaimer and return both messages;
|Phone app|
:Show the answer, with "Listen"
to have it read aloud;
stop
@enduml
